Problem: Validation not enforced before status transitions.
Business value: Prevents low-quality tasks entering execution.
Acceptance criteria:
- Rules specify that `validate:indexes` must pass before moving to `ready-to-do` or `task`
- Optional CI workflow blocks merge when validation fails
- Documentation updated in rules and README
Scope: Rules text + CI workflow.
